- Updated Person.java to include a Role field and getter\n- Added r/ prefix in CliSyntax.java to represent role input\n- Added role parsing support in ParserUtil.java\n- Updated AddCommandParser.java to require a role when adding a contact\n- Updated EditCommandParser.java and EditCommand.java to allow editing roles\n- Updated AddCommand.java and EditCommand.java usage messages to include the role field\n- Updated Messages.format(Person) to display role before name\n\nRemaining work for full feature integration (to be completed by Quang):\n- Update JsonAdaptedPerson.java to serialize and deserialize the Role field\n- Update storage tests such as JsonAdaptedPersonTest.java\n- Update test utilities including PersonBuilder, TypicalPersons, and CommandTestUtil\n- Update JSON test data files to include the new role attribute\n- Update UI components (e.g. PersonCard) if role should be displayed in the contact list\n- Ensure all affected tests pass after integrating the role field across storage and test layers\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":154,"deletions":32},"test-code":{"insertions":100,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-03-12T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"07f2c236ee1366c8aa5a02cb13a335dffcb25425","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #46 from vietquang1006/add-feature","messageBody":"[MVP-F1] Update tests to support new Role class","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"43b0b804cbaa0fad60964efb7bf10db3dc214ae7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from AY2526S2-CS2103T-W13-3/update_add_feature","messageBody":"Update add feature branch from personal fork","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c3423b683b1ca3ffcaeab11081fa60b9d4460376","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix minor stuff to make sure \"./gradlew clean build\" works","messageBody":"Changes made:\n- Modify build.gradle to make it compatible with different MacOS architectures (Intel/Apple Silicon)\n- Fix code style to pass checkStyle tests\n- Add missing \"Role\" components to anywhere applicable\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":43,"deletions":32},"other":{"insertions":17,"deletions":13},"test-code":{"insertions":259,"deletions":230}}},{"hash":"98722da16ac861d6a75c1ef5af9551da274edf1c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #47 from natsupercell/implement_add_feature","messageBody":"Implement add feature","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-15T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"3290d111254c54b5b8ac8066c23a210bb6ad1e9f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #57 from chaiyikang/w9-delete-yikang","messageBody":"Add [y/n] user confirmation safeguard to delete command","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"vietquang1006":[{"date":"2026-03-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"4b9e9ff29dbb4c2d5c151e4054314daf3b5468f1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Quang\u0027s personal info in AboutUs.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"426b9173e38992b88362993c39353ca5fa3fd7f8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #15 from Choy050823/branch-update-personal-info","messageBody":"Fixes #14: Update Min Han\u0027s Personal Information","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-11T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"9c16b93244d24ae104954d45711941caf97c41b2","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #44 from natsupercell/implement_add_feature","messageBody":"Add role field support to person model and command flow","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-12T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"bd74353663ed92a8ec6eff96ec555c37d83db01c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update tests to support new Role class Refactored existing test cases to align with the new Role implementation. Updated test data and assertions to ensure compatibility with role-based logic.","messageBody":"","fileTypesAnd